      "created_at": "2024-09-10T09:17:36.665Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/3/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-09-10 144208\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627_2_690x32.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-09-10 144208\" data-base62-sha1=\"u1boeTMVu5skfEyzYAMjesrKqX\" width=\"690\" height=\"32\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627_2_690x32.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627_2_1035x48.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/3/0364b3817a5586b5ae3b3d19e641b48300114627_2_1380x64.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2024-09-10 144208</span><span class=\"informations\">1519×71 8.65 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>\"I have a Lead in the Lead list view where I added an <code>href</code> link to the address column (e.g., 38, Ab Rd N). When I click on it, it redirects to Google Maps.</p>\n<p>However, when I open the Lead, refresh it, and go back to the list view, than not redirects  on google map</p>",
