    {
      "id": 434312,
      "username": "Govind_Gupta",
      "name": "Govind Gupta",
      "created_at": "2024-09-10T10:15:40.812Z",
      "cooked": "<p>frappe.listview_settings[‘Lead’] = {<br>\nhide_name_column: true, // Hide the last column which shows the <code>name</code><br>\nadd_fields: [“street”, “name”], // Fetch <code>street</code> and <code>name</code> fields for the list view</p>\n<pre><code>onload: function(listview) {\n    console.log('Lead list view loaded');\n},\n\nformatters: {\n    street(val) {\n        // Debug: Log the `street` value\n        console.log(val);\n        if (val) {\n            // Create a Google Maps link using the `street` value\n            return `&lt;a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=${encodeURIComponent(val)}\" target=\"_blank\"&gt;${val}&lt;/a&gt;`;\n        } else {\n            return '';\n        }\n    },\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>};<br>\n“This is my code, and it’s working properly. However, when I open a Lead, refresh the page, and then go back to the list view, it stops working.”</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/govind_gupta/{size}/71540_2.png",
